---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Services · rho-lall.com"
	description="Data architecture, practical governance, BI, AI-native workflows, and focused decision systems for growing ecommerce and lifestyle brands."
>
	<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-5 pb-16 pt-16 sm:px-8 sm:pb-20 sm:pt-24 lg:px-12">
		<div class="max-w-3xl">
			<p class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-primary"><span class="h-px w-9 bg-brand-accent"></span>Services</p>
			<h1 class="mt-7 font-display text-[clamp(3.2rem,7vw,6.5rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.065em]">The work between the technical system and the business system.</h1>
			<p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate sm:text-xl">A focused practice for companies whose stack is carrying more history than it was designed to hold—and whose team still needs to ship this week.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="border-y border-line/70 bg-paper-deep">
		<div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-7xl gap-12 px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20 lg:px-12 lg:py-24">
			<div>
				<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-primary">Five ways in</p>
				<p class="mt-5 max-w-xs text-base leading-7 text-slate">The engagement can start with a specific operational pain or a wider architecture question. The useful work is usually connected.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="grid gap-0">
				<article class="grid gap-4 border-t border-line py-7 sm:grid-cols-[4.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-8">
					<p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-primary">01</p>
					<div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Data architecture + modernization</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate">Restructure Snowflake, dbt, Looker, and cloud data environments around how the business actually works. Consolidate fragmented logic, retire obsolete systems, and evolve the architecture without a ground-up rebuild.</p></div>
				</article>
				<article class="grid gap-4 border-t border-line py-7 sm:grid-cols-[4.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-8">
					<p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-primary">02</p>
					<div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Practical data governance</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate">Clarify definitions, ownership, documentation, and change controls at the scale of a growing team. Preserve the context behind important decisions so it does not stay trapped in executive memory.</p></div>
				</article>
				<article class="grid gap-4 border-t border-line py-7 sm:grid-cols-[4.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-8">
					<p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-primary">03</p>
					<div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Business intelligence + analytics</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate">Build intuitive reporting around the questions operators actually need to answer: customers, acquisition, sales, returns, inventory, fulfillment, merchandising, and finance.</p></div>
				</article>
				<article class="grid gap-4 border-t border-line py-7 sm:grid-cols-[4.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-8">
					<p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-primary">04</p>
					<div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">AI-native knowledge + workflows</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate">Give tools like Claude useful context: code, documentation, data, prior decisions, and repeatable research or analysis processes. Make AI an informed teammate instead of another surface for guesswork.</p></div>
				</article>
				<article class="grid gap-4 border-t border-line py-7 sm:grid-cols-[4.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-8">
					<p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-primary">05</p>
					<div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Decision + automation systems</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate">Design focused software when an important business problem does not fit neatly inside SaaS: research pipelines, financial analytics, optimization tools, agent orchestration, and AI-assisted workflows.</p></div>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 md:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] md:items-center lg:px-12 lg:py-24">
		<h2 class="max-w-md font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.05em] sm:text-5xl">The constraint is part of the brief.</h2>
		<div class="max-w-2xl">
			<p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate">Finance still needs Monday’s numbers. Merchandising still needs to buy inventory. Marketing still needs attribution. A good plan respects those dependencies and creates a path forward while the plane is in the air.</p>
			<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm font-semibold">
				<a href="/about" class="text-brand-primary underline decoration-brand-primary underline-offset-8 transition-colors hover:text-brand-primary">How Rho works <span class="ml-1" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				<a href="/blog" class="text-brand-primary underline decoration-brand-primary underline-offset-8 transition-colors hover:text-brand-primary">Read the field notes <span class="ml-1" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
